 470:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/kernel_util.cc ****     // bias * (bias_scale - input_product_scale) / output_scale should be
 471:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/kernel_util.cc ****     // a small number for an integer.
